    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n23407" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δαμοῦαι:</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἱ ἐπὶ</span>
		
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Μελαντίας πεμπόμενοι</span> (
			Lacon.
		), Id. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δαμοῦχοι</span></b> , οἱ, 
			Dor.
		 for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δημ-,</span> title of a board of
