			 (
				Lacon.
			), Id. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δαμπόν</span></b> , 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πυρίεφθον</span>
			 (Cret.), Id.</div>
